@startuml
title Course registration — domain class diagram
class Student {
  studentId : String
  name : String
}
class Course {
  code : String
  title : String
}
class CourseOffering {
  offeringId : String
  semester : String
  section : String
  capacity : int
  availablePlaces() : int
}
class Enrollment {
  enrollmentId : String
}
Student "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : holds >
CourseOffering "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : receives >
Course "1" -- "1..*" CourseOffering : is offered as >

note right of CourseOffering
  Capacity (R2): count of Enrollments for an offering
  must never exceed its positive capacity.
  Available places = capacity - count of Enrollments.
end note
note right of Enrollment
  Uniqueness (R3): for one Student and one CourseOffering
  pair, at most one Enrollment may exist.
end note
@enduml
